["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Deep Dive on Submarines X-Craft bathyscaphe SSN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-historyhit-击沉贝尔格拉诺号前-副艇长曾当众喝止艇长的开火令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6775897482174464-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">51:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>擊沉貝爾格拉諾號前，副艇長曾當眾喝止艇長的開火令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">核潛艇「征服者」號擊沉阿根廷巡洋艦貝爾格拉諾號前，副指揮官麥克萊蒙曾在控制室喝止艇長，只為等一個更好的射擊角度——那是英國潛艇自二戰以來首次真正開火。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">潛艇史</span><span class=\"tag\">二戰海戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"721. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Outbreak of The Crimean War (Part 1) sublime port plunger cavalry drawl black bottle affair sick man of Europe\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-restishistory-克里米亚战争真正的导火索-只是伯利恒教堂一把钥匙的归属之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/607aa1e9567d043b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>克里米亞戰爭真正的導火索，只是伯利恆教堂一把鑰匙的歸屬之爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">克里米亞戰爭由伯利恆教堂一把鑰匙的歸屬之爭點燃，英法俄三大國在互相猜忌和誤判中，像後來的一戰列強一樣夢遊般捲入了這場衝突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亞戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">維多利亞時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Cisco Got Bullwhipped Bullwhip effect Virtual close Extranet Keiretsu Vendor financing Contract manufacturer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-asianometry-思科自夸能实时看清全球需求-其实看到的是客户重复下的订单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">A</div><span class=\"dur\">31:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>思科自誇能實時看清全球需求，其實看到的是客戶重複下的訂單</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">思科兩個季度庫存分別暴漲87%和58.8%，根源不是需求爆發，而是客戶為搶缺貨重複下單，又被「實時供應鏈」原樣放大轉發給了上游。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">供應鏈管理</span><span class=\"tag\">牛鞭效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"411. Lawrence of Arabia: The Truth Behind The Legend (Part 1) Seven Pillars of Wisdom Carchemish Wilderness of Zin Arab Bureau McMahon-Hussein Correspondence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-09-empirehist-阿拉伯的劳伦斯私下写道-犹太人耕种的农场才是沙漠里的亮点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">54:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1109</span></div>\n<h2>阿拉伯的勞倫斯私下寫道：猶太人耕種的農場才是沙漠裡的亮點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">勞倫斯以「阿拉伯解放者」留名青史，但他親眼見證巴勒斯坦的猶太移民農場後，寫下的卻是「猶太人耕種得越快越好」，這與後世賦予他的形象形成巨大反差。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東史</span><span class=\"tag\">一戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"[One Million AI Engineer Special] How Stanford Teaches AI-Native Engineering — Mihail Eric, Monaco RPI framework sub-agent God box context engineering software factory Manager of Agents\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-08-latentspace-ai让新工程师入职门槛直逼高级工程师水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb1a6f8e94a7eb56-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>AI讓新工程師入職門檻直逼高級工程師水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI工具已經把基礎代碼工作做得足夠好，企業現在要的是能做架構決策和設計取捨的人，所以新畢業生的技能標準被整體拉高了一級。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編程</span><span class=\"tag\">工程教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why PMs are suddenly valuable again | Tulsee Doshi (Head of Product, Gemini) harness Pareto curve of cost to quality chain of thought monitoring flash teams Monk skin tone scale Fitzpatrick scale\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-08-lennys-人人都能一键开发时-pm的核心价值变成了审美与取舍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8b981f0ab567ea7c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">58:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>人人都能一鍵開發時，PM的核心價值變成了審美與取捨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型人人能調，能跑起來的東西不再稀缺；能從一堆能做的事裡挑出真正值得做的那一件，才是PM重新被需要的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">模型評測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 503 Free Market: Dutch Capitalism VOC WIC mercantilism amour propre stadtholder joint-stock company\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-08-hopwag-荷兰资本主义不是新教伦理的产物-而是中世纪经济自然演化的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>荷蘭資本主義不是新教倫理的產物，而是中世紀經濟自然演化的結果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">經濟史學家如今認為，加爾文教與資本主義是在荷蘭自由土壤裡平行生長、彼此強化，而非新教倫理催生了資本主義精神。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資本主義史</span><span class=\"tag\">荷蘭共和國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1373: Challenging Dengue and RIGging Flu ADE (antibody-dependent enhancement) EDE (envelope dimer epitope) RIG-I RNAemia Pol III non-coding RNA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-08-twiv-登革疫苗挑战试验发现-病毒复制太猛或太弱都练不出持久免疫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>登革疫苗挑戰試驗發現：病毒複製太猛或太弱都練不出持久免疫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二次登革感染中病毒載量適中者免疫記憶最強，載量過高反而因IL-12驅動的短命抗體而更快失效，打破了複製越少越安全的直覺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">登革熱</span><span class=\"tag\">抗體依賴增強</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Year of Five Emperors donative Caesar\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-08-ancients-罗马帝位争夺战-决定胜负的不是血统-而是离罗马有多近/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38988d274dfcdf54-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1108</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬帝位爭奪戰：決定勝負的不是血統，而是離羅馬有多近</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">193年爭奪羅馬帝位的五人中，真正決定勝負的是消息傳遞速度——塞維魯比對手早七天得知先帝遇刺的消息，便搶先起兵拿下帝位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">帝位繼承</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Is THIS the AI We Want? Alarming Acceleration, AI Election Bets, GPU Trading &amp; AI-Native VC Responsible Scaling Policy (RSP) BallotBench Move 37 HGX node PostTrainBench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-cogrev-anthropic研发加速已证实-推手不是算力-是算法和数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec28c976f21f448e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic研發加速已證實：推手不是算力，是算法和數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic在IPO文件中承認研發可能已經「戲劇性加速」，METR的獨立評估顯示：這波提速靠的不是更多算力，而是算法和數據質量本身被現有智能推著變好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Midterm Blood Bath, $4T AI Sell Off, Data Center Freeze, What&#x27;s Next for Trump Exponential Time Hypothesis (ETH) P vs NP hyperscalers neoclouds ring of Sauron\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-allin-共和党历史性惨败-选民不分左右-只惩罚解决不了民生的当权者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a68aa6b09f666cd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>共和黨歷史性慘敗：選民不分左右，只懲罰解決不了民生的當權者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">節目復盤發現，砸錢助選和重劃選區這兩件「意識形態武器」全都沒用：真正決定中期選舉的，是特朗普淨支持率從+5%崩到-28%背後的汽油價、柴油價和房貸利率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中期選舉</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build The Future: Paul Graham &amp; Amjad Masad vibe coding harness self-driving company\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-ycsp-软件外包行业基本死了-十万美元的项目现在只要一千美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd057bb57d2a99d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">44:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>軟件外包行業基本死了：十萬美元的項目現在只要一千美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Replit能讓LLM連續調用工具、循環運行直到任務真正完成，而不是像ChatGPT那樣一輪就停——這才是vibe coding的技術突破，也是Masad判斷傳統軟件外包行業已經死掉的底氣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1113 - Nov 7 2026 Lean sortition Navier-Stokes equation mathpocalypse action bias\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-skeptics-openai-一天甩出722篇数学论文-数学家集体看懵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 一天甩出722篇數學論文，數學家集體看懵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">論文長達數百頁卻讀不懂、也查不完，OpenAI只甩出部分Lean驗證代碼自證嚴謹，逼數學界承認人類可能真的跟不上AI證明的速度了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI與數學</span><span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princess Who Swallowed a Glass Piano glass delusion melancholia House of Wittelsbach\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-stuffmissed-她坚信自己吞下了一整架玻璃钢琴-这种妄想曾在欧洲流行数百年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">18:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>她堅信自己吞下了一整架玻璃鋼琴，這種妄想曾在歐洲流行數百年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從中世紀到19世紀初，歐洲反覆出現「我是玻璃做的」這種妄想——法國國王查理六世不許人碰，御醫曾放火燒床逼病人跳起來「治癒」他。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神疾病史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"銳評國模與 Neo Lab，暢談 RL 人生與 RLaaS | 對談 Mind Lab 首席科學家驍騰 RSI LoRA harness discount factor GRPO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-zhangjing-大厂做不出最好的模型-不是技术问题-是账本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>大廠做不出最好的模型：不是技術問題，是賬本問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">驍騰認為大廠的問題不是缺卡缺錢，而是財務賬單逼著管理層把實驗室產出做轉化，這種向心力讓突破性創新很難發生在大廠內部，但它們仍能靠置換算力穩賺錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Martin Wolf on Democratic Capitalism After Trump competitive authoritarianism dirty democracy positional goods citizens&#x27; assembly rentier\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-goodfight-专家阶层自毁信誉的代价-没人能再管住会-终结人类-的ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>專家階層自毀信譽的代價：沒人能再管住會「終結人類」的AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沃爾夫說，知識分子階層已被民粹政治打垮，以至於連Anthropic自己披露「可能終結人類」的風險都無人深究。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民主衰退</span><span class=\"tag\">AI存在性風險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Mark Hyman’s Guide to Living Longer and Staying Strong Peptide Plasmapheresis Urolithin A\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-a16z-肌肉是长寿的硬通货-glp-1减重药正在悄悄拿走它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>肌肉是長壽的硬通貨：GLP-1減重藥正在悄悄拿走它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hyman說肌肉是決定衰弱與否的關鍵資產，而當下流行的GLP-1減重藥在讓人瘦的同時大量流失肌肉，這才是真正該警惕的副作用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">長壽醫學</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白質與肌肉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1372: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin low-dose naltrexone (LDN) target trial emulation screwworm parosmia / phantosmia autochthonous\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-twiv-美国时隔三十年再现麻疹死亡-疫苗怀疑论政策付出代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>美國時隔三十年再現麻疹死亡：疫苗懷疑論政策付出代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本週美國報告三例本可用疫苗完全預防的麻疹死亡——紐約州三十年來首例、威斯康星州三十六年來首例——Daniel Griffin 把這歸咎於衛生高層散布的疫苗錯誤信息，而不是單純的公共衛生運氣不好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Deep Dive: Anthropic S-1 Myths and Mythos — Jamin Ball, Altimeter S-1 converts Jevons Paradox offtake neocloud compute margin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-07-latentspace-anthropic招股书最大误读-千亿美元可转债不是欠的债/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1107</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic招股書最大誤讀：千億美元可轉債不是欠的債</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">資產負債表上1080億美元的可轉換票據負債，只是Google、Amazon所持股權隨公司估值暴漲而產生的會計重估，不是真實欠款。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">招股書</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Providing Capital to Tech Companies: Masters In Business with Ann Berry World Models flight to scale Crapification\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-mastersinbiz-科技巨头谈ai收购时-估值是聊到最后才被提起的问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>科技巨頭談AI收購時，估值是聊到最後才被提起的問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她問科技公司CEO收購AI標的的標準，答案從不主動提價格——這輪競賽裡，佔住位置比算清回報更要緊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI估值</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Lame Duck War, No Pete November, Bay of Tofu + Team Yankee NDAA continuing resolution Starshield revealed preference neoprimes\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-chinatalk-没有胜利理论的伊朗战争-正在冻结整个国防预算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/73075358fb273e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>沒有勝利理論的伊朗戰爭，正在凍結整個國防預算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布萊恩指出，政府從未定義「戰略國家利益」是什麼，所以無法說服國會繼續買單——於是國防授權法案和撥款法案都卡在持續決議裡，直到戰爭以某種方式收場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊朗戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">國防預算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#116 The Hype vs. Data on Saturated Fat, Red Meat, &amp; Seed Oils | Dr. Dariush Mozaffarian GRAS (Generally Recognized As Safe) milk fat globule membrane heme iron resting energy expenditure\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-foundmyfitness-饱和脂肪被冤枉-真正的健康风险藏在食物被加工的方式里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e75b1258b993ca1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">FoundMyFitness</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>飽和脂肪被冤枉：真正的健康風險藏在食物被加工的方式裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同樣含量的飽和脂肪，黃油讓LDL升高，生奶油卻沒有變化——決定健康風險的不是脂肪種類，而是食物被加工、拆解到什麼程度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">飲食健康</span><span class=\"tag\">飽和脂肪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Friend Acquisition Rate Pacing the Frontier bunny suit perps gardening leave lockstep compensation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-moneystuff-法律伦理规则让合伙人说走就走-律所比投行更容易崩盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">44:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>法律倫理規則讓合夥人說走就走，律所比投行更容易崩盤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投行靠競業協議和遞延股票鎖人，律所合夥人受律師執業倫理保護、不能被鎖定——這正是Weil Gotshal一夜崩盤、而投行不會的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">預測市場</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Controlling Biology - Fabian Theis, Helmholtz Munich world model bitter lesson organoid flow matching Lab Compass\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-06-latentspace-一场著名的虚拟细胞竞赛爆冷-线性模型打平了多数深度模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">50:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1106</span></div>\n<h2>一場著名的虛擬細胞競賽爆冷：線性模型打平了多數深度模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一場頂級虛擬細胞競賽證明，簡單線性迴歸能打平許多深度學習模型——問題不在數據信息不夠，而在評測指標和訓練目標本身設計有問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">虛擬細胞</span><span class=\"tag\">擾動預測</span>\n</div></div></a>"]